== Real calls (lab load test, BE-12 path, 4-CPU sandbox)
before: detectors not started on 1 of 50 and 2 of 100 calls (lua(campaign_amd.lua) EXECUTEd, then nothing: no avmd_start, no amd, no verdict)
after: 300 of 300 started (steps 50,100,50,100); the script logged 'not ready at start (CS_EXCHANGE_MEDIA), going on' on 8 of them
